        "answer": {
          "short": "First stage: $P(B)=\\frac58$, $P(W)=\\frac38$. After B: $P(B)=\\frac47$, $P(W)=\\frac37$. After W: $P(B)=\\frac57$, $P(W)=\\frac27$. Events: $P(BB)=\\frac5{14}$, $P(BW)=\\frac{15}{56}$, $P(WB)=\\frac{15}{56}$, $P(WW)=\\frac3{28}$.",
          "worked": "The second draw has 7 marbles remaining.",
          "solutionDiagrams": [
            {
              "id": "p43-q4-tree-solution",
              "role": "solution",
              "format": "tikz",
              "code": "% mathsmap-diagram-colours {\"version\":1,\"kind\":\"geometry\",\"base\":[],\"semantic\":[],\"reference\":\"source page 43 p43-q4-tree-solution\"}\n\\begin{tikzpicture}[x=1mm,y=1mm,draw=black,line width=0.8pt,every node/.style={font=\\fontsize{10}{12}\\selectfont,text=black,inner sep=0.6mm}]\n\\special{dvisvgm:raw <metadata data-graph-strokes=\"1\"/>}\n\\draw (0,0)--(15,16) (0,0)--(15,-16);\n\\draw (15,16)--(32,26) (15,16)--(32,6) (15,-16)--(32,-6) (15,-16)--(32,-26);\n\\node[above left,fill=white] at (7,8) {$\\dfrac58$};\\node[below left,fill=white] at (7,-8) {$\\dfrac38$};\n\\node[above,fill=white] at (24,21) {$\\dfrac47$};\\node[below,fill=white] at (24,11) {$\\dfrac37$};\\node[above,fill=white] at (24,-11) {$\\dfrac57$};\\node[below,fill=white] at (24,-21) {$\\dfrac27$};\n\\node[fill=white] at (15,16) {B};\\node[fill=white] at (15,-16) {W};\n\\foreach \\y/\\a/\\out in {26/B/{B,B},6/W/{B,W},-6/B/{W,B},-26/W/{W,W}}{\\node[anchor=west,fill=white] at (32,\\y) {\\a};}\n\\node[anchor=west,text=blue] at (60,26) {$P(BB)=\\frac{5}{8}\\times\\frac{4}{7}=\\frac{20}{56}=\\frac{5}{14}$};\n\\node[anchor=west,text=blue] at (60,6) {$P(BW)=\\frac{5}{8}\\times\\frac{3}{7}=\\frac{15}{56}$};\n\\node[anchor=west,text=blue] at (60,-6) {$P(WB)=\\frac{3}{8}\\times\\frac{5}{7}=\\frac{15}{56}$};\n\\node[anchor=west,text=blue] at (60,-26) {$P(WW)=\\frac{3}{8}\\times\\frac{2}{7}=\\frac{6}{56}=\\frac{3}{28}$};\n\\end{tikzpicture}",
